{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"639326","name":"Cosmo Apartaments Marina","description":"The elegant and bright Cosmo Apartments Marina - Auditori are located 200 meters from the bullring and Monumental Metro Station. These modern and stylish apartments offer free WiFi, air conditioning, and wooden floors. Each apartment features a flat-screen TV, a living room, a dining area, and a fully equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, microwave, refrigerator, washing machine, tumble dryer, kettle, and coffee maker. Some apartments also include a DVD player and an additional TV in the bedrooms. Glories Shopping Centre, Encantes Market, and Razzmatazz Concert Hall are within 500 meters of the apartments. Barcelona city center is easily accessible, just three metro stops away. Regular bus stops near the property provide convenient access to the city's beaches in 15 minutes. The apartments are also close to the Auditorium, National Theatre, Agbar Tower, and North Bus Station. Check-in and key collection take place at Cosmo Apartments Sants at Passeig Sant Antoni, 30, 08014, Barcelona (24-hour reception, tel: +34 93 339 3786). A €200 deposit (Visa or Mastercard) is required to cover potential damages and will be refunded upon departure, provided everything is in order. Smoking is not permitted, and guests are requested to leave the kitchen clean and dispose of rubbish outside the building.","address":"Ausias March, 136","city":"Barcelona","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08013","lat":41.397499,"lng":2.1841260999999577,"stars":3,"giataCode":"729781","phone":"+34933393786","email":"INFO@COSMOPOLITAGROUP.COM","website":"www.cosmopolitagroup.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/639326/639326a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/639326/639326a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/639326/639326a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"